# REST Client requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension, or JetBrains HTTP client)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@accessToken = paste_access_token_here

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aniket",
  "email": "aniket@example.com",
  "password": "Hackathon2026"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "aniket@example.com",
  "password": "Hackathon2026"
}

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Refresh access token (uses the httpOnly cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh

### Protected example route
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/protected
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Change password
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Hackathon2026",
  "newPassword": "Hackathon2027"
}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout

### Logout of every device
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
